# Single-page application fallback.
#
# Every path on this host shows the profile because the Angular router matches "**", but the static
# host answers an unknown path with its own 404 page instead of booting the application. This rule
# (Cloudflare Pages, Netlify and compatible hosts) rewrites every request that does not match a real
# file to index.html with a 200 status; real assets are still served from the bundle.
/*    /index.html   200
